From: Konrad Dybcio <konrad.dybcio@oss.qualcomm.com>
Date: Wed, 9 Sep 2026 18:41:58 +0200
Subject: [PATCH] interconnect: qcom: msm8996: Configure auxiliary Venus QoS
 port
References: bsc#1012628
Patch-mainline: 7.3.6
